  <name>PySol Lite</name>
  <summary>276 solitaire and patience card games</summary>
  <description>
    <p>PySol Lite is a lighter PySol: 276 solitaire and patience games,
      including Klondike, FreeCell, Spider, Yukon, Forty Thieves, Mahjongg,
      Cribbage and Poker, each with its own rules page in the built-in help.</p>
    <p>It has a Select game dialog with a live preview, unlimited undo and
      redo, hints, favorites and bookmarks, and screen reader support.</p>
  </description>
